      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "开会记几个词,AI补成完整笔记。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 3092.743764172336
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-002",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-002.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "Granola的创始人克里斯在意的,是普通AI纪要的一个毛病:看着完整,却未必记住你的重点。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 7304.24084527428
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-003",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-003.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "他和团队换了个思路:让你随手记下的要点,告诉AI什么最重要。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 5288.1519274376415
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-004",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-004.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "会议里,你照常写几个关键词,Granola在后台转写。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 4204.1298789019165
        },
        {
          "text": "结束后,再把你写的和会上说的合在一起。",
          "startMs": 4490.63829787234,
          "endMs": 7669.631881121243
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-005",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-005.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "像这段演示,几条零散记录,就展开成了分好层次的笔记。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 4160.861678004536
        },
        {
          "text": "开会时,不用为了记全每句话,一直盯着键盘。",
          "startMs": 4441.0,
          "endMs": 7789.163265306122
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-006",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-006.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "他们先和一小群测试用户打磨,再公开推出。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 3204.182413706223
        },
        {
          "text": "早期用的人里,有经常听项目的投资人,也有创业公司负责人。",
          "startMs": 3495.5555555555557,
          "endMs": 7680.136054421768
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-007",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-007.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "按公司当时的说法,产品会从负责人传到团队,笔记也能一键分享给同事。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 5350.626697565473
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-008",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-008.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "到二零二六年三月,公司宣布新融了一亿两千五百万美元,估值十五亿美元。",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 5930.602796674225
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
    },
    {
      "segmentId": "seg-009",
      "file": "episodes/episode-010/audio/seg-009.mp3",
      "timestamps": [
        {
          "text": "回头看那几个关键词,它们留下的是你的判断;",
          "startMs": 0.0,
          "endMs": 3673.0351715154147
        },
        {
          "text": "AI补上的,是让这份判断能被同事看懂的细节。",
          "startMs": 3959.7872340425533,
          "endMs": 7781.034882037922
        }
      ],
      "timestampSource": "minimax:sentence+measured-pacing-transform"
